 "text": [
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 56,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 916,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Hello, stranger"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h1",
   "y": 83,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 916,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Thirty minutes with a stranger lifts people's mood, yet most leave thinking they were liked less than they were"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 248,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 820,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "A study paired strangers for 30-minute video calls: 1,656 conversations, 3,312 sets of ratings, from 1,456 people (754 of them took part more than once). Each person rated their mood before and during the call, then rated their partner and guessed how their partner rated them. Two things stand out. Mood climbs steadily through the conversation. And people consistently guess that their partner thinks less of them than the partner actually does."
  },
  {
   "tag": "b",
   "y": 457,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 292,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "69.2%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "b",
   "y": 457,
   "x": 574,
   "w": 292,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "54.9%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "b",
   "y": 457,
   "x": 886,
   "w": 292,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "0.58"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 506,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 283,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "felt better at the end of the call than before it; 10.3% felt worse"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 506,
   "x": 574,
   "w": 262,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "underestimated how much their partner liked them; 18.3% overestimated"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 506,
   "x": 886,
   "w": 272,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "correlation between a person's shared-reality score and how much they enjoyed the call"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 646,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 916,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Mood rises from the first minute to the last"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 696,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 760,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "On a 1–9 scale, average mood was 6.1 just before the call and 6.16 at the start, so the first moments of meeting were neutral. It then rose to 6.93 by the middle and 7.38 by the end. Energy (arousal) followed: 5.32 before the call and 6.41 after it. Comparing each person's end-of-call mood with their own pre-call rating, 69.2% were higher, 20.5% unchanged and only 10.3% lower."
  },
  {
   "tag": "figcaption",
   "y": 854,
   "x": 285,
   "w": 870,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Average mood rating at four points (1–9 scale), 3,257 people with all four ratings"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 911,
   "x": 344,
   "w": 17,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "8.0"
  },
  {
