   "w": 84,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Before the call"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1141,
   "x": 593,
   "w": 58,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Beginning"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1141,
   "x": 836,
   "w": 39,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Middle"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1141,
   "x": 1078,
   "w": 22,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "End"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 1170,
   "x": 285,
   "w": 870,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Points are means. The y-axis starts at 5 to show the change; on the full scale the rise is about 1.3 points."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 1268,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 916,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The liking gap: people are liked more than they think"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1318,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 760,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "After the call each person said how much they liked their partner and guessed how much the partner liked them, both on a 1–7 scale. On average people gave their partner a 6.00 but expected only a 5.35 in return. The top score of 7 was the most common one given (43% of people), but only 17% guessed they had received it."
  },
  {
   "tag": "figcaption",
   "y": 1448,
   "x": 285,
   "w": 870,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Share of people giving each liking score, against the share guessing they received it"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 1475,
   "x": 285,
   "w": 129,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "\"I like my partner\""
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 1475,
   "x": 432,
   "w": 201,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "\"My partner likes me\" (guess)"
  },
