  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1802,
   "x": 262,
   "w": 760,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Matching each guess to what the partner actually reported (3,206 people with both ratings), 54.9% guessed too low, 26.8% guessed exactly and 18.3% guessed too high. The guesses seem to say more about the guesser than the partner. A person's guess correlates 0.69 with how much they liked the partner, and only 0.19 with how much the partner really liked them. The two partners didn't agree much about the call either: their enjoyment ratings correlate just 0.17."
  },
